Test connection is not established for the disallowed cipher suite
TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA256.

This cipher suite is not listed as supported for TLSv1.2. This implementation
considers this cipher suite as disallowed, although it is not mentioned in the
standard (7.3) as explicitly disallowed. Reason is: the standard says the list
of disallowed cipher suites is not limited.

Expected:
- connection is not established using the only cipher suite
  TLS_DHE_RSA_WITH_AES_256_CBC_SHA256 supported by the server

Assertion:
- tunnel error:
  SSL_do_handshake error: error:0A000410:SSL routines::ssl/tls alert handshake
  failure
- server error:
  tls_post_process_client_hello:no shared cipher